{"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Trackers\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Sampling","title":"Sampling","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SampleRate","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SampleRateKey","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/InvalidSampleRate"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/sampler"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Keeps a fraction of the events it applies to, and drops the rest before they are held, written"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or delivered: event by event, or a whole group of events, such as a session, at once."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A tracker built with samplers runs them on its worker, after its enrichers, so a sampler sees","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"what they set:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let tracker = Tracker(samplers: [","    .events(of: Scrolled.self, rate: 0.1),","    .events(where: { $0.consentCategory == .performance }, rate: 0.5),","])"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each sampler decides on its own, and a record is kept only if every sampler that applies to it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps it. A kept record carries the product of their rates as its "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SampleRateKey","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"; one no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sampler applies to is always kept and carries no key. Each dropped record is reported on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The decisions come from the tracker’s sampling seed, the same on every platform and Swift","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"release: with a seed fixed, which events are kept is fixed too. Each sampler draws from a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stream of its own, picked by its place in the tracker’s list: appending a sampler changes no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"other’s decisions, but inserting, removing or reordering one gives every sampler after it a new","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stream, so it decides differently under the same seed.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sampler"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Sampler","externalID":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV","role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Sampler.swift#L28","fileName":"Sampler.swift"}},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Methods","title":"Type Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/events(of:rate:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/events(where:r